 no key filters |  3 | NOT EXISTS int8 set                        | t         | t          | t     | 1 byte table
 no key filters |  4 | NOT EXISTS, NULL leaf counted              | t         | t          | t     | 1 byte table
 no key filters |  5 | IN keys beyond int32, span 9e9             | t         | t          | t     | 1 byte table
 no key filters |  6 | NOT EXISTS keys beyond int32               | t         | t          | t     | 1 byte table
 no key filters |  7 | IN a window beyond int32                   | t         | t          | t     | 1 byte table
 no key filters |  8 | IN the ends of int8, a span past the table | t         | t          | t     | 1 byte table
 no key filters |  9 | NOT EXISTS the ends of int8                | t         | t          | t     | 1 byte table
 no key filters | 10 | IN the whole table, a span past the table  | t         | t          | t     | 1 byte table
 no key filters | 11 | NOT IN a column without NULL               | t         | t          | t     | 0 byte table
 no key filters | 12 | IN int4 table, int8 leaf                   | t         | t          | t     | 1 byte table
